{"seq":1,"slug":"politics-and-faction","title":"Politics And Faction","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/politics-and-faction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"between-the-factions","title":"党争中的苏轼","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/politics-and-faction/between-the-factions","wordCount":2057,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-statesman-assessed","title":"政治家的评价","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/politics-and-faction/the-statesman-assessed","wordCount":1700,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章审视苏轼的政治生涯。在北宋新旧党争中，苏轼因正直、独立、不阿的立场而&quot;两面不讨好&quot;，屡遭排挤、贬谪——他既反对新党变法的激进，也反对旧党尽废新法的因循，以国家百姓利益为重。这种政治上的&quot;失意&quot;，恰恰源于其人格上的&quot;伟大&quot;。本章还评价了苏轼作为政治家的得失——地方政绩突出，大舞台上却相对失意，折射出文人从政的困境。本章以辩证的态度评价苏轼的政治生涯。</p>\n"}